\item OpenAI, \emph{Rokhlin's multiple-mixing problem for one transformation}, 2026-09-23; citation key \texttt{OAI:Rokhlins-multiple-mixing-problem-for-one-transformation-September-23-2026}. \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Rokhlins-multiple-mixing-problem-for-one-transformation-September-23-2026/paper.pdf}{PDF (GitHub)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/raw/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Rokhlins-multiple-mixing-problem-for-one-transformation-September-23-2026/paper.pdf}{PDF (direct)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Rokhlins-multiple-mixing-problem-for-one-transformation-September-23-2026/README.md}{Manuscript page and citation}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/main/preprints/Rokhlins-multiple-mixing-problem-for-one-transformation-September-23-2026/paper.pdf}{Latest version}; Statement source: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Rokhlins-multiple-mixing-problem-for-one-transformation-September-23-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex\#L21}{thm:main}.
\item Family 145: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/docs/145.md}{Lean scope}.
\item \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/ComparatorChallenges/Rokhlin.json}{Comparator Rokhlin.json}.
